{"5245810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ForgeTax","steam_appid":5245810,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your hammer can make a fortune. The next hit can turn it to scrap.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ForgeTax is a dark, first-person roguelite about forging swords, bending the odds, and paying tribute to the dragon that owns your forge.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAMMER YOUR LUCK<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/ea78c397e8bd99572dc3a99444f37fae.poster.avif?t=1791135247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/ea78c397e8bd99572dc3a99444f37fae.webm?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/ea78c397e8bd99572dc3a99444f37fae.mp4?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat a blade. Bring it to the anvil. Push its value higher with every successful strike—or watch it shatter. Forge the same sword 10 times to charge Frenzy, then unleash it on the next hit: a brief, blazing window to hammer without fear of shattering.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURN SWORDS INTO SYNERGIES<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/89b1c68bfd95dbae2ce44cb322f4abfd.poster.avif?t=1791135247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/89b1c68bfd95dbae2ce44cb322f4abfd.webm?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/89b1c68bfd95dbae2ce44cb322f4abfd.mp4?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relic machine takes swords. Every blade you spend on a relic is one less blade for the dragon. Change your draw tickets, combine strange effects, and turn a handful of advantages into ridiculous value. Build around your luck, or change what luck means.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DRAGON IS WAITING<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/50def6974498fda5d7858da7bc8c107a.poster.avif?t=1791135247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/50def6974498fda5d7858da7bc8c107a.webm?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/50def6974498fda5d7858da7bc8c107a.mp4?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay your swords on the counter and ring the bell. Meet the tribute and earn another round at the anvil. Fall short, and something beyond the bars begins to lose patience. Decide what to keep, what to sacrifice, and when to stop swinging.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay the dragon. Forge your revenge.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your hammer can make a fortune. The next hit can turn it to scrap.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ForgeTax is a dark, first-person roguelite about forging swords, bending the odds, and paying tribute to the dragon that owns your forge.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAMMER YOUR LUCK<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/ea78c397e8bd99572dc3a99444f37fae.poster.avif?t=1791135247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/ea78c397e8bd99572dc3a99444f37fae.webm?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/ea78c397e8bd99572dc3a99444f37fae.mp4?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat a blade. Bring it to the anvil. Push its value higher with every successful strike—or watch it shatter. Forge the same sword 10 times to charge Frenzy, then unleash it on the next hit: a brief, blazing window to hammer without fear of shattering.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURN SWORDS INTO SYNERGIES<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/89b1c68bfd95dbae2ce44cb322f4abfd.poster.avif?t=1791135247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/89b1c68bfd95dbae2ce44cb322f4abfd.webm?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/89b1c68bfd95dbae2ce44cb322f4abfd.mp4?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relic machine takes swords. Every blade you spend on a relic is one less blade for the dragon. Change your draw tickets, combine strange effects, and turn a handful of advantages into ridiculous value. Build around your luck, or change what luck means.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DRAGON IS WAITING<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/50def6974498fda5d7858da7bc8c107a.poster.avif?t=1791135247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/50def6974498fda5d7858da7bc8c107a.webm?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/extras\/50def6974498fda5d7858da7bc8c107a.mp4?t=1791135247\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay your swords on the counter and ring the bell. Meet the tribute and earn another round at the anvil. Fall short, and something beyond the bars begins to lose patience. Decide what to keep, what to sacrifice, and when to stop swinging.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay the dragon. Forge your revenge.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"A dark, first-person forging roguelite. Hammer swords into absurd fortunes, bend the odds with relics, and risk it all on your next strike. Spend precious blades to build powerful synergies. Meet the dragon's tribute—or face its wrath.","supported_languages":"Korean, English, German, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/f7f624422d8033d03706758d5f03fe197b48257c\/header.jpg?t=1791135247","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/b07737239f4189629dd481b55e8054d2dad50fd9\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791135247","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5245810\/b07737239f4189629dd481b55e8054d2dad50fd9\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791135247","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6600 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li>